                    "q": "(vi) Tubules secretes ions such as hydrogen, potassium, and NH3 into the filtrate while reabsorbing the HCO3- from the filtrate are called\n(a) Distal convoluted tubule\n(b) Proximal convoluted tubule\n(c) Collecting duct\n(d) Loop of Henle"
