                    "a": "The long-tailed tailor-bird builds a hanging nest between leaves with twigs and grass. A young tailor-bird builds the nest to acquire a mate, although it has not learned nest building from older birds and has had no prior experience in such a task; it builds the nest by its instinct behaviour.",
