                    "q": "(ii) Which is not the part of chromosomal theory of inheritance.\n(a) Gametes do not make equal hereditary contribution\n(b) Chromosome segregate during meiosis\n(c) Nucleus is the room of hereditary material\n(d) Gametes have one copy of homologous chromosome"
