                    "q": "Green seed colour (G) is dominant over yellow (g). Find the genotypes of the parents from these F1 results: (i) Green x yellow — 82 green, 78 yellow; (ii) Green x Green — 118 green, 39 yellow; (iii) Yellow x yellow — 0 green, 50 yellow; (iv) Green x yellow — 74 green, 0 yellow; (v) Green x Green — 90 green, 0 yellow."
