                    "q": "(vii) The pair of compounds that exhibit isomerism is:\n(a) C2H5-OH and C3H7-OH (b) CH3-CH2-CH2-CH3 and CH3-CH(CH3)-CH3 (c) C2H5-CH2-Cl and C3H7-CH2-Cl (d) CH3-NH2 and CH3-CH2-NH2"
