                    "a": "PV = nRT is obtained by combining Boyle's law (V ∝ 1/P), Charles's law (V ∝ T) and Avogadro's law (V ∝ n), giving V ∝ nT/P, i.e. PV = nRT.",
                    "q": "How is the general gas law obtained from the gas laws?"
