                    "q": "10. An electron moves parallel to a uniform magnetic field. What is the magnitude of the force experienced by the electron?\n(a) Maximum, since the electron is moving in the same direction as the field\n(b) Minimum, since the electron is moving perpendicular to the field\n(c) Zero, since the electron is moving parallel to the field\n(d) Depends on the speed of the electron"
