                "a": "(i) lim_{x->1} (x^2 + 4)^3 = (1 + 4)^3 = 125\n(ii) lim_{x->0} 4/(x - 4) = 4/(0 - 4) = -1\n(iii) lim_{x->infinity} 5/(5x + 10) = 0\n(iv) lim_{x->7} (x^2 - 49)/(x - 7)\n= lim_{x->7} (x - 7)(x + 7)/(x - 7)\n= lim_{x->7} (x + 7)\n= 14\n(v) lim_{x->0} (sqrt(x + 3) - sqrt(3))/x\n= lim_{x->0} (x + 3 - 3)/(x(sqrt(x + 3) + sqrt(3)))\n= lim_{x->0} 1/(sqrt(x + 3) + sqrt(3))\n= [[1/(2sqrt(3))]]\n(vi) lim_{x->7} (x - 7)/(sqrt(x) - sqrt(7))\n= lim_{x->7} (sqrt(x) - sqrt(7))(sqrt(x) + sqrt(7))/(sqrt(x) - sqrt(7))\n= lim_{x->7} (sqrt(x) + sqrt(7))\n= 2sqrt(7)\n(vii) lim_{x->0} (1 + x/3)^(5/x)\n= lim_{x->0} [(1 + x/3)^(3/x)]^(5/3)\n= e^(5/3)\n(viii) lim_{x->0} (1 + ax)^(a/x)\n= lim_{x->0} [(1 + ax)^(1/(ax))]^(a^2)\n= e^(a^2)\n(ix) lim_{x->infinity} (1 + p/x)^(px)\n= lim_{x->infinity} [(1 + p/x)^(x/p)]^(p^2)\n= e^(p^2)\n(x) lim_{x->infinity} (1 - pq/x)^(x/p)\n= lim_{x->infinity} [(1 - pq/x)^(-x/(pq))]^(-q)\n= e^(-q)\n(xi) lim_{x->0} (17^x - 1)/x = ln 17\n(xii) lim_{h->0} ((1 + 2h)^n - 1)/(5h)\n= (1/5) lim_{h->0} ((1 + 2h)^n - 1)/(2h) x 2\n= (2n/5) lim_{h->0} ((1 + 2h)^n - 1)/(n.2h)\n= [[2n/5]]\n(xiii) lim_{x->0} (2^x - 4^x - 8^x - 1)/(x + 2)\n= (1 - 1 - 1 - 1)/(0 + 2)\n= -[[2/2]]\n= -1\n(xiv) lim_{x->0} ((1 + 7x)/(1 - 9x))^(1/x)\n= lim_{x->0} (1 + 7x)^(1/x)/(1 - 9x)^(1/x)\n= e^7/e^(-9)\n= e^16\n(xv) lim_{x->0} (a^x - b^x)/x\n= lim_{x->0} (a^x - 1)/x - lim_{x->0} (b^x - 1)/x\n= ln a - ln b\n= ln(a/b)\n(xvi) lim_{x->0} (e^(-2x) - e^(-11x))/x\n= lim_{x->0} (e^(-2x) - 1)/x - lim_{x->0} (e^(-11x) - 1)/x\n= -2 - (-11)\n= 9\n(xvii) lim_{x->0} (3e^(-5x) - 5e^(-2x) + 2)/x\n= 3 lim_{x->0} (e^(-5x) - 1)/x - 5 lim_{x->0} (e^(-2x) - 1)/x\n= 3(-5) - 5(-2)\n= -15 + 10\n= -5\n(xviii) lim_{x->0} (1 + 3tan x)^(cot x)\n= lim_{x->0} [(1 + 3tan x)^(1/(3tan x))]^(3tan x.cot x)\n= e^3\n(xix) lim_{x->2} (x^4 - 16)/(x^3 - 8)\n= lim_{x->2} (x^2 - 4)(x^2 + 4)/((x - 2)(x^2 + 2x + 4))\n= lim_{x->2} (x + 2)(x^2 + 4)/(x^2 + 2x + 4)\n= (4)(8)/12\n= [[8/3]]\n(xx) lim_{x->infinity} (2x - x^2)/(3x^2 - 4x + 1)\n= lim_{x->infinity} (2/x - 1)/(3 - 4/x + 1/x^2)\n= -[[1/3]]",
                "q": "Evaluate the limits of following algebraic and exponential functions:\n(i) lim_{x->1} (x^2 + 4)^3\n(ii) lim_{x->0} 4/(x - 4)\n(iii) lim_{x->infinity} 5/(5x + 10)\n(iv) lim_{x->7} (x^2 - 49)/(x - 7)\n(v) lim_{x->0} (sqrt(x + 3) - sqrt(3))/x\n(vi) lim_{x->7} (x - 7)/(sqrt(x) - sqrt(7))\n(vii) lim_{x->0} (1 + x/3)^(5/x)\n(viii) lim_{x->0} (1 + ax)^(a/x)\n(ix) lim_{x->infinity} (1 + p/x)^(px)\n(x) lim_{x->infinity} (1 - pq/x)^(x/p)\n(xi) lim_{x->0} (17^x - 1)/x\n(xii) lim_{h->0} ((1 + 2h)^n - 1)/(5h)\n(xiii) lim_{x->0} (2^x - 4^x - 8^x - 1)/(x + 2)\n(xiv) lim_{x->0} ((1 + 7x)/(1 - 9x))^(1/x)\n(xv) lim_{x->0} (a^x - b^x)/x\n(xvi) lim_{x->0} (e^(-2x) - e^(-11x))/x\n(xvii) lim_{x->0} (3e^(-5x) - 5e^(-2x) + 2)/x\n(xviii) lim_{x->0} (1 + 3tan x)^(cot x)\n(xix) lim_{x->2} (x^4 - 16)/(x^3 - 8)\n(xx) lim_{x->infinity} (2x - x^2)/(3x^2 - 4x + 1)"
