                "a": "(i) u = 3x^2 + 9x + 3\ndu = (6x + 9) dx\n∫(3x^2 + 9x + 3)^[[1/2]] (6x + 9) dx = ∫u^[[1/2]] du\n= [[2/3]]u^[[3/2]] + C\n= [[2/3]](3x^2 + 9x + 3)^[[3/2]] + C\n(ii) u = ax^2 + 2bx + c\ndu = 2(ax + b) dx\n∫sqrt(ax^2 + 2bx + c) (ax + b) dx = [[1/2]]∫u^[[1/2]] du\n= [[1/3]]u^[[3/2]] + C\n= [[1/3]](ax^2 + 2bx + c)^[[3/2]] + C\n(iii) u = 3x^2 + 5x + 2\ndu = (6x + 5) dx\n∫[[(6x + 5)/sqrt(3x^2 + 5x + 2)]] dx = ∫[[du/sqrt(u)]]\n= 2sqrt(u) + C\n= 2sqrt(3x^2 + 5x + 2) + C\n(iv) u = x^2 + 4x + 3\ndu = (2x + 4) dx\n∫(x^2 + 4x + 3)^(-9) (2x + 4) dx = ∫u^(-9) du\n= -[[1/8]]u^(-8) + C\n= -[[1/(8(x^2 + 4x + 3)^8)]] + C\n(v) (x - 2)(x - 3)(x - 4) = x^3 - 9x^2 + 26x - 24\n∫(x - 2)(x - 3)(x - 4) dx = ∫(x^3 - 9x^2 + 26x - 24) dx\n= [[x^4/4]] - 3x^3 + 13x^2 - 24x + C\n(vi) (2x^2 - 3)^2 = 4x^4 - 12x^2 + 9\n∫(2x^2 - 3)^2 dx = ∫(4x^4 - 12x^2 + 9) dx\n= [[4/5]]x^5 - 4x^3 + 9x + C\n(vii) u = x^3 - 3x^2 + 9\ndu = 3(x^2 - 2x) dx\n∫(x^3 - 3x^2 + 9)^[[7/2]] (x^2 - 2x) dx = [[1/3]]∫u^[[7/2]] du\n= [[2/27]]u^[[9/2]] + C\n= [[2/27]](x^3 - 3x^2 + 9)^[[9/2]] + C\n(viii) (x^2 - 5)^3 = x^6 - 15x^4 + 75x^2 - 125\n∫(x^2 - 5)^3 dx = ∫(x^6 - 15x^4 + 75x^2 - 125) dx\n= [[x^7/7]] - 3x^5 + 25x^3 - 125x + C\n(ix) u = cos x + sin x\ndu = (cos x - sin x) dx\n∫(cos x + sin x)^[[3/2]] (cos x - sin x) dx = ∫u^[[3/2]] du\n= [[2/5]]u^[[5/2]] + C\n= [[2/5]](cos x + sin x)^[[5/2]] + C\n(x) u = tan x + sin x\ndu = (sec^2 x + cos x) dx\n∫(tan x + sin x)(sec^2 x + cos x) dx = ∫u du\n= [[1/2]]u^2 + C\n= [[1/2]](tan x + sin x)^2 + C",
                "q": "معياري فارمولن کي استعمال ڪندي هيٺين غير معين تڪاملن جا ملهه معلوم ڪريو.\n(i) ∫(3x^2 + 9x + 3)^[[1/2]] (6x + 9) dx\n(ii) ∫sqrt(ax^2 + 2bx + c) (ax + b) dx\n(iii) ∫[[(6x + 5)/sqrt(3x^2 + 5x + 2)]] dx\n(iv) ∫(x^2 + 4x + 3)^(-9) (2x + 4) dx\n(v) ∫(x - 2)(x - 3)(x - 4) dx\n(vi) ∫(2x^2 - 3)^2 dx\n(vii) ∫(x^3 - 3x^2 + 9)^[[7/2]] (x^2 - 2x) dx\n(viii) ∫(x^2 - 5)^3 dx\n(ix) ∫(cos x + sin x)^[[3/2]] (cos x - sin x) dx\n(x) ∫(tan x + sin x)(sec^2 x + cos x) dx"
